\begin_layout Subsubsection
Measuring the Baseline
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
To measure an accurate value for the baseline, this can be done determined
 by fitting interferometric data for a point source using Equation 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand vref
reference "eq:fringe amplitude for pt"

\end_inset

.
 This equation has three unknown quantities; the time delay due to the cable,
 
\begin_inset Formula $\tau_{c}$
\end_inset

, the baseline 
\begin_inset Formula $B_{y}$
\end_inset

, and the declination of the target 
\begin_inset Formula $δ$
